  "definition": "Approval of Special Discharges of Limited Duration",
  "effectiveDate": "2021-07-24",
  "historyNote": "(See Revision Note at part heading for Env-Wq 305) #10381, eff 8-1-13; ss by #13241, eff 7-24-21",
